sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FS as Watcher
    participant W as MainWindow
    participant E as SyncEngine
    participant SY as core.sync
    participant C as ApiClient
    participant API as Сервер
    FS->>W: directoryChanged
    W->>W: затримка 1,5 с
    W->>E: run_once()
    E->>SY: scan_folder()
    SY-->>E: local
    E->>C: list_files()
    C->>API: GET /api/files
    API-->>C: remote
    E->>SY: load_base()
    E->>SY: plan_sync()
    SY-->>E: план дій
    E->>C: upload(a.xml)
    C->>API: POST /api/files
    E->>C: download(b.png)
    C->>API: GET content
    E->>E: атомарний запис b.png
    E->>C: upload(c (конфлікт).xml)
    E->>C: download(c.xml)
    E->>SY: save_base()
    E-->>W: SyncReport
    W->>W: журнал, refresh()
